  "text": "AFK Osseous\n\n​\nDisclaimer\n⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S)\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work\n​\nPositioning\nStand in the middle of the arena, east of the skeleton:\n\n​\nRequirements\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • Cutting corners will result in failure\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel\n\nMandatory\n⬥ Igneous Kal-Mor  / \n⬥ Spectral Scythe (Upgrade 2) \n⬥ Greater Bone Shield \n⬥ Pray Soul Split  + Sorrow  / Ruination \nNon-mandatory (may boost your KPH)\n⬥ Undead Slayer perk \n⬥ Equilibrium perk \n⬥ Ultimatums perk \nCommon issues\n⬥ Zorgoth's soul ring  may cause timing issues\n⬥ Darkness  and Deathwarden robes  may prevent  from healing you\n⬥ You are <99 Constitution  - use Bonfire Boost  and Ogre flask (thermal) \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\nPresets\n⬥ Necromancy - Death Dealer Robes \n⬥ Necromancy - Robes of the First Necromancer \n​\n\nAction Bar\n\n​\nExamples\n⬥ Example AFK kills\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• 00:00-01:51 First Necromancer Robes Preset\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• 01:52-end Deathdealer Robes Preset\n​\n\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "AFK Osseous ​ Disclaimer ⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S) ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work ​ Positioning Stand in the middle of the arena, east of the skeleton: ​ Requirements ⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work: • Cutting corners will result in failure • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel Mandatory ⬥ Igneous Kal-Mor / ⬥ Spectral Scythe (Upgrade 2) ⬥ Greater Bone Shield ⬥ Pray Soul Split + Sorrow / Ruination Non-mandatory (may boost your KPH) ⬥ Undead Slayer perk ⬥ Equilibrium perk ⬥ Ultimatums perk Common issues ⬥ Zorgoth's soul ring may cause timing issues ⬥ Darkness and Deathwarden robes may prevent from healing you ⬥ You are <99 Constitution - use Bonfire Boost and Ogre flask (thermal) ​ Presets ⬥ Necromancy - Death Dealer Robes ⬥ Necromancy - Robes of the First Necromancer ​ Action Bar ​ Examples ⬥ Example AFK kills ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• 00:00-01:51 First Necromancer Robes Preset ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• 01:52-end Deathdealer Robes Preset ​",
